    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d321">

                <pb facs="0507" n="405" xml:id="pg405"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 10793/1.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister for Foreign Affairs of Guatemala to the
                        Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-01-06"><hi rendition="#italic">January 6,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Work on Interoceanic Railway completed yesterday. We earnestly wish an American
                    delegation will come to inauguration 19th instant.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Juan Barrios.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
